    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### {{CLINIC_NAME}} - Medical Records Management System (PET WF6)\n\n**🎯 Purpose:** Comprehensive medical records management with data completeness verification and automated documentation\n\n**🚀 Features:**\n• **Data Completeness Checks:** Validates pet history forms and staff notes completion\n• **Smart Reminders:** Automated SMS for clients and email for staff when documentation is incomplete\n• **Medical Records Creation:** Generates complete medical records from visit data\n• **Multi-Database Updates:** Updates both dedicated medical records and master appointment hub\n• **Client Communication:** Confirms medical record updates via email\n\n**⚡ Workflow Process:**\n1. **Triggered by Visit Completion:** Activated by PET WF3 when visits end\n2. **Pet History Verification:** Checks if client completed pet history form\n3. **Staff Notes Verification:** Waits 1 hour, then checks staff documentation\n4. **Medical Record Generation:** Creates comprehensive medical record with all visit details\n5. **Database Updates:** Updates medical records system and master appointment hub\n6. **Client Notification:** Sends confirmation email about record updates\n\n**📊 Integration Points:**\n• Master Appointments: {{MASTER_APPOINTMENTS_SHEET_ID}}\n• Medical Records DB: {{MEDICAL_RECORDS_SHEET_ID}}\n• Pet History Form: {{PET_HISTORY_FORM_URL}}\n• Medical Records System: {{MEDICAL_RECORDS_SYSTEM_URL}}\n\n**⚙️ Configuration:**\n• Clinic: {{CLINIC_NAME}}\n• Default Veterinarian: {{DEFAULT_VETERINARIAN}}\n• Admin Email: {{ADMIN_EMAIL}}\n• Business Contact: {{BUSINESS_PHONE_NUMBER}} / {{BUSINESS_EMAIL}}",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 800,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -300,
        -100
      ],
